# Insert beat — form-first unified pipeline

## One factory

- New BG dialogue beats MUST be created via `POST /api/bg/insert-beat` with validated `plan_row` (speaker + dialogue).
- Materialization MUST go through `materialize_sidecar_beat_from_plan_row()` → `build_beats_from_approved_plan()`.
- **Never** restore `create_blank_bg_beat()` or `+ Add empty beat`.

## Banned

- `create_blank_bg_beat` / speaker-empty O3 rows
- `o3_voice_stack_pin` on new inserts
- `o3_prompt_box_law` on system-built insert prompts
- Skipping `validate_element_list_alignment()` because of a pin

## Proven stack

- O3 submit uses `get_proven_element_list_entry(speaker)` when `proven_o3_bind` exists.
- `finalize_proven_element_beat()` copies char/bg ref from `proven_from_beat_id`.
- After materialize, **always** `sync_element_char_ref_status(beat, heal_mismatch=False)`.
- Insert path must call `maybe_auto_register_beat_char_ref()` (same hook as char-ref drop on `bg_update_beat`).

## Regression gates

- `Production/scripts/verify_insert_beat_form_first_durability.sh`
- `Production/tools/tests/test_insert_beat_form_first.py` (also in `verify_o3_intro_contract.sh`)

